
# MedSync Health, Inc.
# Employee Handbook

## Welcome to MedSync Health!

This handbook provides a guide to our company culture, policies, and procedures. We are excited to have you as part of our team and look forward to your contributions to our mission of transforming healthcare.

## Code of Conduct

All employees are expected to maintain the highest standards of professionalism, integrity, and ethical conduct. We are committed to creating a respectful and inclusive work environment for everyone.

## Work Hours & Attendance

Our standard work hours are 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM, Monday through Friday. We offer flexible work arrangements, including remote work options, with manager approval.

## Performance Reviews

Performance reviews are conducted twice a year, in June and December. These reviews are an opportunity to discuss your performance, set goals, and receive feedback.

## Compensation

We offer a competitive compensation package, including base salary, performance-based bonuses, and equity. Salaries are reviewed annually.

## Benefits

MedSync Health offers a comprehensive benefits package, including:
- Medical, dental, and vision insurance
- 401(k) with company match
- Paid time off and holidays
- Parental leave
- Professional development stipend

*This handbook is not a contract of employment. MedSync Health reserves the right to modify or update these policies at any time.*
